@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@chatId = 1
@otherUserId = 2

================
GET
================
Description:
Get all chats for the logged-in user.
Returns chat list with members and last message preview.

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

================
POST
================
Description:
Create or open private chat with another user.
If chat already exists, backend returns existing chat.
If not, backend creates a new private chat.

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chats/private
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "otherUserId": {{otherUserId}}
}

================
GET
================
Description:
Get all messages from selected chat.
Used by ChatDetailView to display full message history.

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

================
POST
================
Description:
Send message to selected chat.
Backend uses JWT token as senderId and finds receiverId from chat members.

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "content": "Hello, this is a test message."
}